{302}{Really?  That's splendid!  A most fortitudious situation!  You have my most heartfelt thanks, and you can pass along this bridge anytime! [He gives you a key.] You might just make a good thief, my friend.  In fact, I might just have some information about becoming one if you're interested...}{Really?  That's splendid!  A most fortitudious situation!  You have my most heartfelt thanks, and you can pass along this bridge anytime! [He gives you a key.] You might just make a good thief, madam.  In fact, I might just have some information about becoming one if you're interested...}{}{}{}{qu1033 4, in -4402}
